{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ %@" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "A brand new welcome, with the logo that builds itself, and the Today widget." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un tout nouvel accueil, avec le logo qui s’assemble tout seul, et le widget Aujourd’hui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wild ride with Tom and Nico" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un super trip entre Tom et Nico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In July %@, Locky was still “soon on the App Store”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En juillet %@, Locky était encore « bientôt sur l’App Store »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locky leaves the App Store: iOS 11 and macOS High Sierra broke its Bluetooth. RIP ☠️" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Locky quitte l’App Store : iOS 11 et macOS High Sierra ont cassé son Bluetooth. RIP ☠️"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the display back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remettre l’écran en place"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rotate the display" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Faire pivoter l’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ film" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le film de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The film promised “soon on the App Store”. Locky lived there from 2015 to 2017; this time, it stays between us." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le film promettait « bientôt sur l’App Store ». Locky y a vécu de 2015 à 2017 ; cette fois, il reste entre nous."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first film of Locky goes online." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le premier film de Locky est mis en ligne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "at Lunabee Studio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "chez Lunabee Studio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back in %@, Tom and Nico dreamed of a Mac that locks itself when you walk away. Here is the video from back then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En %@, Tom et Nico rêvaient d’un Mac qui se verrouille tout seul quand tu t’éloignes. Voici la vidéo de l’époque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discover Lunabee Studio" : {
      "localizations" : {
